~ Generic lithium-ion pack of identical cells in parallel. All values are assumptions for an 18650-class cell until a real cell is chosen.

Cell capacity: C = 3 :Ah

    ~ Assumed.

Cell voltage: V = 3.7 :V

    ~ Assumed nominal voltage.

Cell mass: m_c = 47 :g

    ~ Assumed.

Cell count: n = 1

    ~ Design choice. Parallel cells add capacity and keep the voltage.

Usable fraction (0, 1): eta = 0.8

    ~ Assumed share of capacity that can be drawn before cutoff.

Stored energy: E = n * C * V :Wh

Mass: m = n * m_c :g
